    "en": "(At that moment, I see faint white lines on Millia’s wrist as she replaces the cup. I lower my eyes and say nothing. Nei-chan trembles slightly.)",
    "ja": "Tamaki「お金も共感もいらない。“自他非分離”の経済。おうちの冷蔵庫と一緒」"
